{"server":"tw","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_08_beg","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_08","title":"滲透作戰","storyCode":"OD-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b93f0566f6dc74f498d6f28ebd3e98a23f579d0283c8b14d0405065e8f814e2d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"Ash按照計劃來到了長泉鎮礦坑，一切真相大白。瘋狂科學家列維也穿越到了這個世界，與領主長子沆瀣一氣，繼續他的瘋狂實驗。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_labentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"巡林者的地圖只畫到這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來就只能靠我們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"這個洞穴......沒想到這麼大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼來看，整個鎮子的地下都是空的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"爆炸物沒問題吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......安全屋裡威力最大的那一批都在這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"希望Lord的計劃有效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕沒有那麼簡單，看那邊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"......希望不是我想的那種......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畸變體感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畸變體感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_015","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"不管它是什麼，它會死，就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"現在不管出現什麼鬼東西我都不會覺得奇怪了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"不要纏鬥，儘量突破，我們沒有時間浪費在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_labcorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼長泉的地下會有一個這樣的設施？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"寇恩......這裡是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"我就知道！我*粗口*就知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"原來大部分實驗室都被傳送到這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"現在想想，都是我們太大意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"在這個鎮子上生活了這麼久，竟然毫無察覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事情的背後，就是那個瘋子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼味道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"還能是什麼，死亡的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"保持警惕，跟緊點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"這都是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"籠子？這麼多籠子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"全都是屍體......人和動物混在一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"這都是列維•克里奇科的傑作，此人的瘋狂和殘忍超乎常人想像。怪我當初還想過活捉，就應該一槍打穿他的腦門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"一般的瘋子還做不到這麼恐怖的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......籠子裡有個活人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看誰來了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"是那個德魯奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"這混帳東西就是燒成灰我也認得。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是你們，是那群雇傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很高興看到你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道我們之前有過很多矛盾......但是這些矛盾都可以擱置一邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜你們要找那個學者......我知道他在哪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在有一個共同的敵人，在這件事上我們應該能夠合作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"這人的臉皮厚得讓我感到噁心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊那個菲林，我知道你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的身手還是很好認的，哥倫比亞的雇傭兵市場上能打聽到很多消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是個殺手，對吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島願意雇傭你，說明即便是羅德島也有很多髒活要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起其他人，你一定更懂得權衡利弊，我們來談談吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......閉嘴，或者我讓你閉嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是遺憾，我以為像你這樣的人會更加務實。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"把籠子打開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，把籠子打開就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就對了，大家都是明白人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我當然是個明白人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你要做什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac17_11"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你！你瘋了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救命......救......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德魯奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別......別打了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，你還能說話，說明打得還不夠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"avg_npc_158_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一拳，是為了米亞羅醫生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，別打了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"你下手也太狠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼......你還同情他?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"好傢伙，你都快把他打死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"臉都打變形了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"省點力氣吧，我們還有事要幹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"你說得對。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，只是感覺心情舒暢了很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，我也舒暢多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"這傢伙被關在這裡，看起來也是被列維算計了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"我一點都不覺得驚訝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lab"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒看到有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_npc_166","isRemote":false,"text":"......謹慎一點，可能會有埋伏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧瞧是誰來了，我的實驗寶地又有訪客了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"許久不見，虹彩小隊的朋友們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們來得正是時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......你們每次來得都正是時候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要費勁了，這面玻璃是防彈的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對你的果斷表示贊許，板機扣得毫不猶豫，不等人體面地結束開場白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但讓我們回到這場戲來吧，美好的開場需要優秀的觀眾，美好的開場也需要完整的開幕致辭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天是讚頌造物主偉業的日子，而這個造物主，就是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"造物主？你還真敢給自己的臉上貼金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"你這個喪心病狂的瘋子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瘋子......呵。庸人最喜歡用這個詞來形容他們不能理解的思維和想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看這個世界，看看這個世界！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"截然不同的化學性質......完全顛覆的物理法則......科學之花要在探索和懷疑中綻放，這個充滿未知的大地就是最好的土壤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而現在，我成功了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們看到了嗎？你們感到了嗎？就在那乍看極為類似的表象之下，萬事萬物運作的原理全然不同！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是生命的進化，這是存在的反覆運算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石就是這個世界的真理，你們應當接納它，而不是恐懼它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎來到未來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"你對自己的所作所為就沒有一絲道德上的抵觸嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"人命在你看來究竟是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人性本質軟弱，善惡是軟弱前提下的主觀定義，老生常談的愧疚感則不過是我們大腦產生的無數種認知信號之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我所追求的科學，從來不會被這種軟弱與模糊的概念所左右。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要自欺欺人了，即便是在這個世界，你依然嘗試用你那種毫無意義的概念來束縛自己的思維。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便是電子資訊技術，核能源......這些技術最初的來源都是為了彼此更高效地互相殺戮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你還想給科學添加一層新的定義？讓一切都符合你稚嫩的精神需求？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愚昧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我原諒你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們可以不明白，我允許你們不明白。思維滯後是一種普遍存在的愚昧，這不是你們的錯，我原諒你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的致辭結束了，除了原諒，我還要感謝諸位的耐心等待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，讚美吧——讚美這種全新的生命形態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"列維","speakerId":"avg_npc_157_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讚美——讚美——讚美！！！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac17_12"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ASH","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"無論付出什麼代價，絕不能讓這個東西到地面上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"BLITZ","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"你們拖住它！我安裝炸彈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_456_ash","aliases":["ASH"]},{"speakerId":"char_457_blitz","aliases":["BLITZ"]}]}
